{"name": "Doom ChessMaster", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When prophecy fails and the hero is absent, who will guide the dying world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the chess master upon the ruins, wielding wisdom as a torch, leading the last of the strong on an expedition to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras_big/fa44d631f5a720a61b37810d4d95a6eb.avif?t=1786987840\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/fa44d631f5a720a61b37810d4d95a6eb.avif?t=1786987840\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras_big/2f3bed57274d164bfc6bc7ffed15872b.webp?t=1786987840\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/2f3bed57274d164bfc6bc7ffed15872b.avif?t=1786987840\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200bWielding exclusive authority, they can switch combat stances in battle; each authority carries a unique team aura, rewriting the course of war through tactical combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"618\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/3ae0e6dccd329114f5cd4f816adb5c73.poster.avif?t=1786987840\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/3ae0e6dccd329114f5cd4f816adb5c73.webm?t=1786987840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/3ae0e6dccd329114f5cd4f816adb5c73.mp4?t=1786987840\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras_big/93b52c84c23bc6931cf77f7215cb3d6f.webp?t=1786987840\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/93b52c84c23bc6931cf77f7215cb3d6f.avif?t=1786987840\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break through mortal limits in the baptism of the apocalypse, freely ascend via multi-dimensional growth paths, and forge a top-tier combat force uniquely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"618\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/fd5c25df881a9bb1b7b67aa81beed0d2.poster.avif?t=1786987840\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/fd5c25df881a9bb1b7b67aa81beed0d2.webm?t=1786987840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/fd5c25df881a9bb1b7b67aa81beed0d2.mp4?t=1786987840\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras_big/304c84f7e521efef0c0ce28bb13f2b1b.webp?t=1786987840\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/extras/304c84f7e521efef0c0ce28bb13f2b1b.avif?t=1786987840\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse the shattered land, encounter heroes of all paths, and gradually piece together the hidden past of the apocalyptic end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge formidable foes in stages and cycles, gather strength, and advance toward the deepest reaches of the world to uncover the ultimate truth that could overturn everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "The end has come. Who will save us? You are the \"Player\" surviving in ruins. No chosen heroes\u2014only the strong remain. Gather them, plan carefully, use gear to change fate. Truth lies in the wreckage. Dare you play?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398650/da9ee18aabe9537a15785a2fe659d698a7e25ccd/header.jpg?t=1786987840", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "Strategy", "Pixel Graphics", "Action", "Adventure", "Action Roguelike"], "developers": "Sublime Studio", "publishers": "Sublime Studio", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4398650", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "15 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/5g0IrSzHWxQ", "first_seen": 1786744800.0, "review_rank": 130}